  "title": "Meatball Sub Sandwich",
  "description": "Meatball subs in soggy, falling-apart buns are just the worst. If you toast the Tailgaters Brat Buns, the heftier, toasty bread will stand up to all that meaty, marinara, mozzarella goodness.",
  "authors": [
    "Ball Park Buns"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-03-21T00:57:51-04:00",
